  "result": "I haven't changed any code yet, because plan mode is active and the tool for submitting a plan for approval is disabled in this session. The plan is saved at `<home>\\.claude\\plans\\defaults-configured-through-default-map-serene-kahn.md`.\n\n**Cause:** in `Context.__init__` (`src/click/core.py:386-392`), a subcommand's context inherits the parent's whole `default_map`. It should take only the entry for its own command name. With `default_map={'runserver': {'port': 5000}}`, the `runserver` context looks for `port` at the top level and finds nothing.\n\n**Fix:** change `default_map = parent.default_map` to `default_map = parent.default_map.get(info_name)`. A missing entry gives `None`, so no default is applied. This matches what `docs/commands.md` describes.\n\n**Also planned:**\n- A test in `tests/test_context.py` with a group and a subcommand using `default_map={'sub': {'port': 5000}}`, plus a nested-group case.\n- A `CHANGES.md` entry.\n- A run of `pytest tests/` to check nothing else breaks.\n\nApprove the plan, or exit plan mode, and I'll make the changes.",
